---
description: Remix development guidelines
alwaysApply: true
---

## Routes

Routes should remain thin.

Responsibilities:

- loader
- action
- response

Move business logic into services.

## Loaders

Loaders fetch data only.

Avoid complex transformations.

## Actions

Actions validate input.

Call services.

Return responses.

## Components

Use:

useLoaderData

useActionData

Keep components presentational.

## Validation

Validate all incoming data before calling services.

## Error Boundaries

Create meaningful error boundaries for user-facing routes.

## Forms

Prefer Remix forms over custom fetch requests where possible.

## Data Flow

Request

↓

Loader / Action

↓

Service

↓

Repository

↓

Prisma

↓

Database